# Needs scripts/check-depends.py found in a package whose fix means a long rebuild:
# `<package> <version> <depends to add...>`. They are tolerated only while the package is still
# at that version. scripts/check.sh fails as soon as its PKGBUILD moves on without them, which is
# when it is being rebuilt anyway: add them to depends then and drop the line.
